            "detailed_description": "Os melhores amigos, Arina e Frendt, encontram uma série de jardins surreais repletos de objetos que fizeram parte de suas infâncias. Juntos, eles embarcam em uma jornada emotiva que os leva a ver a importância de sua amizade: memórias construídas, o que vale a pena ser lembrado e o que deve permanecer no passado.<br><br>Perdidos em um reino onde causa e efeito são maleáveis, eles descobrem que o tempo flui em várias direções. Manipule o tempo para resolver quebra-cabeças e alcançar o ponto mais alto de cada ilha, enquanto a dupla explora os momentos mais marcantes de sua amizade, iluminando constelações e lembranças nesta narrativa agridoce.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600990/extras/b34332fb2e516f2492c7d78c8362a812.avif?t=1784510229\" width=616 height=134 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reception</h2>The Gardens Between has been described as “The Simplest Deep Game Possible” , 2017). <br>It has been selected and featured in several games festivals, awards and exhibitions across the world including Indie MEGABOOTH (PAX East), Out of Index, ACMI and BIC Fest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600990/extras/f07e22df61df37bbecdf987878153d4c.avif?t=1784510229\" width=616 height=134 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art &amp; Music</h2>Experience the Breathtaking Art &amp; Music of The Gardens Between with our Album Length 'Ambient Slow Trailer' at<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Voxel Agents</h2>The Voxels Agents create delightful games that unravel in surprising ways. Headquartered in Melbourne, the studio was founded in 2009 by Simon Joslin, Matthew Clark and Tom Killen to create games that kindle curiosity with a passion for highly focused gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600990/extras/dffe7c29453b6da4a991aa418a36fdea.avif?t=1784510229\" width=616 height=134 /></span>",
            "about_the_game": "Os melhores amigos, Arina e Frendt, encontram uma série de jardins surreais repletos de objetos que fizeram parte de suas infâncias. Juntos, eles embarcam em uma jornada emotiva que os leva a ver a importância de sua amizade: memórias construídas, o que vale a pena ser lembrado e o que deve permanecer no passado.<br><br>Perdidos em um reino onde causa e efeito são maleáveis, eles descobrem que o tempo flui em várias direções. Manipule o tempo para resolver quebra-cabeças e alcançar o ponto mais alto de cada ilha, enquanto a dupla explora os momentos mais marcantes de sua amizade, iluminando constelações e lembranças nesta narrativa agridoce.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600990/extras/b34332fb2e516f2492c7d78c8362a812.avif?t=1784510229\" width=616 height=134 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reception</h2>The Gardens Between has been described as “The Simplest Deep Game Possible” , 2017). <br>It has been selected and featured in several games festivals, awards and exhibitions across the world including Indie MEGABOOTH (PAX East), Out of Index, ACMI and BIC Fest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600990/extras/f07e22df61df37bbecdf987878153d4c.avif?t=1784510229\" width=616 height=134 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art &amp; Music</h2>Experience the Breathtaking Art &amp; Music of The Gardens Between with our Album Length 'Ambient Slow Trailer' at<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Voxel Agents</h2>The Voxels Agents create delightful games that unravel in surprising ways. Headquartered in Melbourne, the studio was founded in 2009 by Simon Joslin, Matthew Clark and Tom Killen to create games that kindle curiosity with a passion for highly focused gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600990/extras/dffe7c29453b6da4a991aa418a36fdea.avif?t=1784510229\" width=616 height=134 /></span>",
